<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-127.2-supply-reconciliation-pre-sop-scenario-planning" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3913" name="W3913. Supply Review &amp; Capacity/Constraints Plan" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Consensus demand (links to W3907)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Supply plan across 4 DCs, ~800–1,000 vendors, 2–3x weekly replenishment
Owner: Supply Planning / S&amp;OP
Participants: Supply Planning (links to VS-02), S&amp;OP Lead, Logistics/DC (links to VS-04/VS-06), Sourcing/Vendor (links to VS-03/VS-122), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Commodity (links to VS-106)
Source: workflow W3913 — Supply Review &amp; Capacity/Constraints Plan</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3913_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3913_Lane1" name="Supply Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3913_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3913_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3913_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3913_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3913_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3913_Start3" name="Consensus demand (links to W3907)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3913_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3913_Task4" name="Supply Planning translate the consensus demand (links to W3907) into a supply…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Supply Planning translate the consensus demand (links to W3907) into a supply plan: vendor capacity, PO/release schedule (links to VS-03/VS-02), import-container plan (links to VS-122/VS-02.2), DC throughput capacity (links to VS-04), and transportation capacity (links to VS-06/VS-110)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Sourcing / Logistics
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3913_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3913_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3913_Task5" name="Supply Planning identify supply constraints (vendor capacity limits, MOQ…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Planning identify supply constraints (vendor capacity limits, MOQ, import lead times 45–90 days links to VS-122, DC/transport capacity, commodity availability links to VS-106, DG/hazmat transport links to VS-114) and quantify the gap to demand
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Functions
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3913_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3913_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3913_Task6" name="Supply Planning document supply options to close gaps (alternate vendors links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Supply Planning document supply options to close gaps (alternate vendors links to VS-03/VS-122, expedites, capacity expansion, substitution) and feed pre-S&amp;OP (links to W3916)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Sourcing
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3913_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3913_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3913_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3913_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-611 (ensure controlled execution — Supply Reconciliation, Pre-S&amp;OP &amp; Scenario Planning (PA-127.2).) | - operational: explicit supply review; operational: long-horizon planning
Owner: Supply Planning / S&amp;OP</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3913_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3913_Annotation8" targetRef="W3913_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3913_Flow10" sourceRef="W3913_Start3" targetRef="W3913_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3913_Flow11" sourceRef="W3913_Task4" targetRef="W3913_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3913_Flow12" sourceRef="W3913_Task5" targetRef="W3913_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3913_Flow13" sourceRef="W3913_Task6" targetRef="W3913_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
