    <bpmn:process id="W_W3914" name="W3914. Inventory &amp; Replenishment Plan Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Supply plan (W3913); inventory policy review
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Inventory plan across 200 stores + 4 DCs; ~6–8x turn target
Owner: Supply Planning / Inventory
Participants: Supply Planning (links to VS-02), Inventory (links to VS-05), S&amp;OP Lead, DC (links to VS-04), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Logistics (links to VS-06)
Source: workflow W3914 — Inventory &amp; Replenishment Plan Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3914_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3914_Lane1" name="Supply Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3914_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3914_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3914_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3914_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3914_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3914_Start3" name="Supply plan (W3913); inventory policy review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3914_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3914_Task4" name="Supply Planning/Inventory set inventory targets by SKU/class (ROP/safety stock…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Supply Planning/Inventory set inventory targets by SKU/class (ROP/safety stock links to profile §6.6, A/B/C policy), reconcile projected inventory position (on-hand + in-transit + PO vs demand), and project weeks-of-supply and turn by category/region
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Inventory
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3914_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3914_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3914_Task5" name="Supply Planning identify inventory risks (overstock slow-movers links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Planning identify inventory risks (overstock slow-movers links to VS-64/VS-05.3, stockout A-items, obsolete links to VS-05.3, stranded/damaged links to VS-90) and corrective actions (rebalancing transfers links to profile §7.4, markdown links to VS-101/VS-64, expedites)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Merchandising / Logistics
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3914_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3914_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3914_Task6" name="Supply Planning align the replenishment plan (2–3x weekly per store links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Supply Planning align the replenishment plan (2–3x weekly per store links to profile §7.2) and cycle/seasonal build to the consensus plan, and feed pre-S&amp;OP (links to W3916)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Store Ops
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3914_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3914_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3914_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3914_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-72 (ensure S&amp;OP consensus &amp; financial reconciliation.) | - operational: turn/WOS targets; operational: safety-stock policy and sensing (links to W3910)
Owner: Supply Planning / Inventory</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3914_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3914_Annotation8" targetRef="W3914_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
