        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: S&amp;OP Lead present the monthly plan, KPI scorecard (links to W3925), scenario options (links to W3917), and the decision list (gap-to-target links to W3912, capacity/financial constraints links to W3918, supply risks links to W3913/W3915)
