Responsible (R): Executives / S&amp;OP Lead
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3919_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3919_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
