    <bpmn:process id="W_W3920" name="W3920. S&amp;OP Plan Publication &amp; Cross-Function Alignment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Exec S&amp;OP decision (W3919)
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: 1 published plan/month cascaded to execution
Owner: S&amp;OP Lead
Participants: S&amp;OP Lead, Supply (links to VS-02), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Finance (links to VS-101/VS-17.4), Marketing (links to VS-14), Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-110), Sourcing (links to VS-122/VS-03), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Trade (links to VS-11/VS-107)
Source: workflow W3920 — S&amp;OP Plan Publication &amp; Cross-Function Alignment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3920_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3920_Lane1" name="S&amp;OP Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3920_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3920_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3920_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3920_Lane2" name="Functions">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3920_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3920_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3920_Start4" name="Exec S&amp;OP decision (W3919)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3920_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3920_Task5" name="S&amp;OP Lead publish the approved constrained plan (volume/margin by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: S&amp;OP Lead publish the approved constrained plan (volume/margin by category/region/SKU-family over the horizon) as the single source for execution: PO/release schedule (links to VS-02/VS-03), import plan (links to VS-122), replenishment (links to VS-02), promo/marketing plan (links to VS-14/VS-58), and financial plan alignment (links to VS-101)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3920_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3920_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3920_Task6" name="Functions consume the plan into their operational cycles: Supply → PO/releases…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Functions consume the plan into their operational cycles: Supply → PO/releases (links to VS-02/VS-03/VS-122), Merchandising → markdown/assortment (links to VS-01/VS-101), Marketing → promo execution (links to VS-14/VS-58), Finance → reforecast/budget (links to VS-17.4/VS-101), Logistics → capacity (links to VS-06/VS-110)
Responsible (R): Functions
Accountable (A): Function VPs
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3920_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3920_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3920_Task7" name="S&amp;OP Lead communicate plan changes vs prior month (delta and rationale) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: S&amp;OP Lead communicate plan changes vs prior month (delta and rationale) and ensure execution alignment, with adherence tracking into the next cycle (links to W3926)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3920_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3920_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3920_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3920_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-611 (ensure controlled execution — Supply Reconciliation, Pre-S&amp;OP &amp; Scenario Planning (PA-127.2).) | - operational: plan-adherence KPI (links to W3925/W3926); operational: change discipline
Owner: S&amp;OP Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
